        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Pt 2:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achï monïngo Noa. Kipö man Noa, chi nyo kitenate ompö piko pïntanyi. Kilïmchinö Noa nko Tororöt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Noa werkachi sömök, Syem nko Am nko Yapet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsïwa Tororöt ngwïny lö kiwïr akinyïghï pich cho le penyï kore kïmïkul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtopön Tororöt ngwïny akïsïwa lö kinyara tya, ompöwölo kirïp chi anka tïkwïl arenyi nyo gha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Tororöt Noa, “Kamachan awang ptangengmöt ompö ngwïny. Owuran chane löwïr ompöwölo kenyïghit chane ghöyityö ngwïny. Owuran chane nko ngwïny tïkwïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ighchinö kegh meli nyo pö ket cho karamach cho ongeröch aimala manka lam ori nko sany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyï wölo itektonyi: koghïntanyi kï miten 133, töpesïntanyi kï miten 22 aikany kïlïkwï miten 13 kutok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aipar melinoni kïlïkwï sömök, nyo pö ngwïny, nyo pö kwen nko nyo pö parak aikany kïsïch kukat atole kamas aitek pörkö, atolapay ipïstö pöroyïn pö monchök nyo ngata sentimiten 44 nyo pesyot pörkö nko meli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Opunan puseryon nyo lumöy kor kïmïkul nyo tïghöy tïkwïn löwïr cho sötote cho mi ngwïny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo oman muma* nko nyi. Ilïtenyi meli nko korkengu nko werköku nko korukwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ailutenyi melinoni tyonkïn lapay odeny odeny nyo le kïrkït nko nyo sakate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilutenyi tarit anka tïkwïl nko tyonkïn cho echön nko cho mïnkech tökesörï chane tömömeghö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay icheng omisyewut löwïr cho kyomöy airor tökïlïkwï omisyenkwa nko tyonchoni imitenyi tïkwïl meli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Epr 11:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh Noa kïgh anka tïkwïl lenyini kimwochï Tororöt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
